WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.260
On your phone, open Quick update.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:05.709
Tap Add a review.

3
00:00:05.709 --> 00:00:10.824
Paste their words exactly.
Do not tidy them up.

4
00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:13.556
Their first name, the way
they would like it shown.

5
00:00:13.556 --> 00:00:16.392
And their town.

6
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:18.619
Google reviews keep their stars.

7
00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:23.079
Tap the button. It is on
the website in minutes.
